			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>VelociReps Apple Health bridge v1. Receives only workout start, active duration, estimated kcal, and opaque retry IDs. No server requests. Retry records live in the Shortcuts folder. A pending record requires checking Health before retrying. Keep this Shortcut name unchanged.</string>
